  "$comment": "MK8 Mode asset sources (MK-93, ADR 0009). Metadata only: the pipeline never downloads. Put each model's extracted files in $MK8_RAW/models/<id>/ (default .mk8-raw/). assetId is the source site's asset id where known (null = not looked up yet). Optional per model: obj (path of the OBJ inside its folder when there is more than one), decoration (material-name regexes to simplify), collision (courses: false to skip the collision export). Sheets (MK-95): each sprite sheet's image at $MK8_RAW/<raw>; a raw ending in / is a folder (the extracted zip). Sound packs (MK-94): each pack's extracted WAVs in $MK8_RAW/audio/<id>/; which files are used is in src/mk8/audio/soundIds.ts and voiceEvents.ts.",
